        "Id1": {
            "text": "This'll be my year by the band Train was followed by the pop rock song Mermaid. Train followed Mermaid with the John Lennon song, Imagine, which is preceded by Power to the People and followed up by Happy Xmas (War is Over)."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "The Train song Mermaid of the genre of pop rock was preceded by the song This'll be my year, followed by John Lennon song Imagine that was followed by the release of the song Happy Xmas (War is Over). The cover was preceded by the song Power to the People."
        },
        "Id3": {
            "text": "The pop rock genre song Mermaid by Train had been preceded by the song This'll Be My Year and followed by the release of Imagine by John Lennon performed by Train. The John Lennon song Imagine was preceded by the song Power to the People and followed by Happy Xmas (War Is Over)."
        }
